# -----------------------------------------------
# .NET / C# specific
# -----------------------------------------------
## Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/
**/Release/
**/Debug/

## User-specific files
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.lock.json
*.dotnet.user
*.dotnet.sln.ide

## Package files
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

## Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

## Logs
**/logs/
*.log

## Entity Framework
**/Migrations/*.Designer.cs
!**/Migrations/*.Designer.cs
**/Migrations/*.cs
!**/Migrations/InitialCreate.cs   # optional: keep initial migration if you want

## App settings with secrets (keep sample, ignore actual)
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json
!appsettings.Development.template.json   # optional

## Local database files
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.db
*.sqlite

## Rider / VS Code
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

